# a chord's shapes: the Chords page's knob goes through them on each root. A short scale has fewer: the knob skips the
# same notes. The slate's chord follows into the garden's name. A project from the arp's build keeps its chords.
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 100
expect par28 0
spin K1 1
expect par28 1
wait 100
shot seventh.png
spin K1 1
expect par28 2
spin K1 1
expect par28 3
spin K1 1
expect par28 4
wait 100
shot sus4.png
spin K1 1
expect par28 5
wait 100
shot add9.png
spin K1 1
expect par28 6
spin K1 1
expect par28 7
wait 100
shot next_root.png
spin K1 -7
expect par28 0
# Afterglow (Shoreline): E pentatonic major
turn PRESET 5
wait 100
expect piece 5
spin K2 1
expect par29 1
spin K2 1
expect par29 3
spin K2 -1
expect par29 1
spin K2 -1
expect par29 0
# from the arp's build: the same chord
turn PRESET -5
wait 100
storev6 4
reboot
wait 300
expect par28 19
tap SAVE
wait 200
reboot
wait 300
expect par28 19
